# Deny-by-default: only the scaffold below is meant to be committed.
# Everything else is generated per-API-key and reveals your account's API inventory.
#
#   committed : pyproject.toml, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md,
#               src/parse_apis/__init__.py, src/parse_apis/py.typed
#   generated : src/parse_apis/_manifest.json
#               src/parse_apis/<slug>/            (typed client, README, example)
#               src/parse_apis/AGENTS.md          (cross-API index)
#               src/parse_apis/CLAUDE.md          (cross-API index)
#
# Re-create the generated payload any time with:  uv run parse sync
# Add a CI drift check with:                        uv run parse sync --check

/src/parse_apis/_manifest.json
/src/parse_apis/AGENTS.md
/src/parse_apis/CLAUDE.md
/src/parse_apis/*/
